# Git Workflow Rules (VERVEAI — BA v1.4.5)

## 🌿 Branch Naming
```
<type>/VP-<id>-<short-desc>

feature/VP-123-add-dashboard
fix/VP-456-fix-api-error
hotfix/VP-789-critical-bug
refactor/VP-234-improve-components
docs/VP-345-update-adr
test/VP-456-add-dashboard-tests
chore/VP-567-update-deps
```

## 📝 Commit Format (Conventional Commits)
```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

<body>

<footer>
```

### Types
| Type | Mục đích |
|------|----------|
| `feat` | Tính năng mới |
| `fix` | Bug fix |
| `docs` | Tài liệu |
| `style` | Format code (không đổi logic) |
| `refactor` | Refactor (không đổi behavior) |
| `perf` | Performance |
| `test` | Thêm/sửa test |
| `chore` | Build, deps, tooling |
| `revert` | Revert commit trước |

### Scopes
| Scope | Vùng |
|-------|------|
| `(web-portal)` | Next.js/TypeScript web portal |
| `(service)` | 5 microservice — generic (nếu commit chạm nhiều service) |
| `(svc-auth)` | `service/service-auth/` — Authentication, Users |
| `(svc-bkt)` | `service/service-bkt/` — BKT, Diagnosis, Evidence, Interventions |
| `(svc-class)` | `service/service-class/` — Classes, Students, Progress |
| `(svc-content)` | `service/service-content/` — Content, Bundles, Review, Reports |
| `(svc-sync)` | `service/service-sync/` — Sync, Devices |
| `(gateway)` | `service/gateway/` — API Gateway |
| `(infra)` | `infra/` — Docker compose, Prometheus, Consul config |
| `(engine)` | `app/lib/engine/` — Lớp 2 BKT, diagnose, item_selection |
| `(inference)` | `app/lib/inference/` — Lớp 1 & 3 extraction, expression |
| `(storage)` | `app/lib/storage/` — SQLite append-only |
| `(hub)` | `app/lib/hub/` — SC-05 hub cục bộ |
| `(sync)` | `app/lib/sync/` — SC-06 USB exchange |
| `(ui)` | Flutter UI / React components |
| `(privacy)` | Privacy rules |
| `(content-pipeline)` | TypeScript authoring/verify/export |
| `(research)` | Python analysis |
| `(adr)` | ADR mới / cập nhật |
| `(docs)` | Cập nhật docs/ |
| `(deps)` | package versions |

### Rules
- Subject ≤ 72 ký tự, **imperative mood**
- Body ≤ 100 ký tự/dòng, giải thích **why**
- Footer: `Refs:`, `Fixes:`, hoặc `BREAKING CHANGE:`

## ✅ EXAMPLES

```bash
# web-portal dashboard
git commit -m "feat(web-portal): add teacher dashboard

Dashboard shows student progress and intervention groups.
Optimized for tablet use in classroom.

Refs: VP-123, CO-T-01"

# Microservice - svc-auth
git commit -m "feat(svc-auth): add JWT refresh token

Implement refresh token rotation for extended sessions.
Tokens expire after 7 days of inactivity.

Refs: VP-234, SR-01"

# Microservice - svc-bkt
git commit -m "feat(svc-bkt): add BKT diagnosis endpoint

Implement Bayesian Knowledge Tracing with fixed parameters.
Deterministic — same input produces same output.

Refs: VP-345, FR-06, FR-07, FR-11"

# Microservice - gateway
git commit -m "feat(gateway): add JWT verification policy

Verify JWT at gateway level before routing to services.
Services trust X-User-Id, X-User-Role headers from gateway.

Refs: VP-456"

# Microservice - shared (circuit breaker)
git commit -m "feat(infra): add opossum circuit breaker config

Wrap all inter-service calls with circuit breaker.
Trip at 50% error rate, reset after 10s.

Refs: VP-567, ADR-0004"

# Flutter engine
git commit -m "feat(engine): add BKT mastery tracking

Implement Bayesian Knowledge Tracing with fixed parameters.
Deterministic — same input produces same output.

Refs: VP-234, FR-06, FR-07, FR-11"

# ADR mới
git commit -m "docs(adr): add ADR-0004 microservice architecture

Decision record for 5-service backend with Gateway and Consul.
Supersedes monolith backend/ structure.

Refs: ADR-0004"

# Docker compose
git commit -m "chore(infra): update docker-compose for 5 services

Add svc-auth, svc-bkt, svc-class, svc-content, svc-sync.
Add Consul for service discovery, Jaeger for tracing.

Refs: VP-789"
```

## ❌ NEVER
- `git commit -m "update"` / `"fix bug"` / `"WIP"`
- Commit trực tiếp vào `main`
- Commit `.gguf`, `*.verveai-bundle.zip`, khoá riêng Ed25519
- Squash nhiều concern vào 1 commit
- Commit `.env`, `*.pem`, khoá riêng
- Commit data thật (PII) — phải ẩn danh trước (DR-08)
- Commit `.env` của bất kỳ service nào

## 🔀 PR Rules
- Title: Conventional Commits (`feat(svc-auth): ...` hoặc `feat(web-portal): ...`)
- Mô tả: What + Why + Test + Risk
- Reviewer tối thiểu 1; merge chỉ khi CI xanh + review approve
- Mỗi PR chỉ thuộc 1 scope (hoặc `service` nếu chạm nhiều service)
- PR cho service mới phải kèm Docker setup trong `infra/`

## 🔀 Branching Strategy

```
main (protected)
├── feature/VP-xxx-*      # Tính năng mới
├── fix/VP-xxx-*          # Bug fix
├── refactor/VP-xxx-*     # Refactor
├── docs/VP-xxx-*         # Tài liệu
├── test/VP-xxx-*         # Test
├── chore/VP-xxx-*        # Build, deps
├── hotfix/VP-xxx-*       # Fix khẩn cấp
└── adr/VP-xxx-*         # ADR mới
```

## 🏷️ Tagging Releases

```bash
# Version format: v{MAJOR}.{MINOR}.{PATCH}
git tag -a v1.0.0 -m "Initial release - Phase 1 web-portal + Phase 2 microservice"
git push origin v1.0.0

# Cho từng service (nếu cần):
git tag -a svc-auth/v0.1.0 -m "Auth service initial release"
git push origin svc-auth/v0.1.0
```

## 📋 PR Checklist

- [ ] Branch name đúng format (`<type>/VP-<id>-<desc>`)
- [ ] Commit message đúng format Conventional Commits
- [ ] Có test cho code mới
- [ ] Coverage không giảm (theo rule trong `07-testing.mdc`)
- [ ] Không có secret, `.env`, khoá trong code
- [ ] Docker compose update nếu thêm service mới
- [ ] Consul config update nếu thêm service mới
- [ ] ADR update nếu thay đổi kiến trúc
- [ ] CI pipeline xanh
